{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id32402449"}, "name":{"label":"Aleeh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-09-27T07:41:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1456778258"}, "title":{"label":"Best app for this"}, "content":{"label":"This app combines the best aspect of duolingo with your own tasks. I've game-ified my life with this. \n\nMy stretching activity steak has relinquished me of my lower back pain! \n\nBest part of my day is completing these mini-goals", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id23132088"}, "name":{"label":"Philsy63"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-09-26T12:57:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"1456350156"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"I had high hopes for this after reading reviews. However, I'm disappointed. \n\nThe health monitoring replicates Apple's built in  health and activity apps, and I can see no advantage in using Streak. \n\nHowever, I bought the app to encourage me to form new habits, such as drinking more water, and here it falls short. I was expecting it to give me regular nudges throughout the day until I hit my two litre goal. However, it only seems to give one massive two litre target. \n\nNot great for a relatively expensive app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id35804070"}, "name":{"label":"GazzG"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-09-22T01:46:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.0"}, "id":{"label":"1453846924"}, "title":{"label":"Streak to organise your life!"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using Streaks for almost a year & it's totally improved & organised my life!\nUnfortunately it's taken me all this time to discover all/most of the features & I'm still learning! \nA full list of instructions, tips & tricks at the beginning would have been nice, as there are MANY tips & tricks to learn before you really can use Streaks to its full potential. \nBut I wouldn't be without it now & at 79years 'young', I've got it all together at last!\nThank you Streaks!  Now just keep me going for the next 20 years!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
