{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id211453563"}, "name":{"label":"Mrmintos"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-08-23T02:55:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.4"}, "id":{"label":"1437821189"}, "title":{"label":"Life changing"}, "content":{"label":"By using this app everyday I have changed my life. When you're on day 67 of physical exercise and you're feeling tired there is no way you're going to miss a day and go back to zero. If you use this app diligently your life will change 🙌🏾  \nI have checked many ritual building apps after reading the life changing \"POWER OF FULL ENGAGEMENT\" book and this is without doubt the best. Choosing just 6 behaviours makes you focused on actually getting them installed into your life as effortless as brushing your teeth rather than having a huge unmanageable list (as I have done). The feature of having stats for the last month and last 7 days is also exactly on point. Many others give you your stats since the birth of the app which means if you fall off for 4 months you can never get to the rewarding acknowledgment of high percentages. \n\nThank you STREAK team for a such a simple, beautiful, elegant and compelling solution to installing rituals into ones life. You are providing a powerful infrastructure for people to make incredible change and do good work in the world. Keep doing what you're doing 🙏🏾✨👊🏾", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
