{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id37516200"}, "name":{"label":"M4RCUS2000"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2016-07-11T13:39:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.3"}, "id":{"label":"1409896235"}, "title":{"label":"Nice idea, in theory"}, "content":{"label":"The app has an interesting if non-standard design, which can make some tasks such as undoing an action quite unintuitive, but it does look rather nice.\nUnfortunately the concept of the app is rather flawed. While I had every intention of completing the items on my list it ended up being just another excuse for my computer to beep at me, which is stressful and irritating. I ended up uninstalling. \nUltimately I think I have to be motivated by a higher cause, an app just doesn't do it for me.  Your mileage may vary of course.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
